{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Illuminate or perish.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step in Illumination of Mansion is dangerous. You wield nothing but a lantern and pure skill to map an haunted mansion tile by tile. The floor plan is a living puzzle; one wrong move awakens the heyulas beneath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086710/extras/ad4d696b5ea1136ea9bc0497fcfc1d6b.poster.avif?t=1760366922\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086710/extras/ad4d696b5ea1136ea9bc0497fcfc1d6b.webm?t=1760366922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2.5D-Immersive Minesweeper Puzzles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate hallways and chambers as you tackle classic Minesweeper logic mapped\u00a0onto a mansion. Simply throw your cards to reveal tiles, count adjacent heyulas, and clear every shadowed corner. No gadgets, no upgrades... just pure puzzle mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dark Fantasy Horror Art!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a richly detailed hand-painted fantasy. Encounter stylized werewolves and\u00a0haunting heyulas against a backdrop of flickering torches. It\u2019s atmospheric mystery,\u00a0not jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086710/extras/ee459e2ae8f29b73786f62a246070c36.poster.avif?t=1760366922\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086710/extras/ee459e2ae8f29b73786f62a246070c36.webm?t=1760366922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grid-Based Strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chamber is a carefully designed grid where one mis-step can send you back to\u00a0the entrance. Study your patterns, spot safe zones, and push your deductive skills to\u00a0the limit to illuminate deeper reaches of the mansion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mysterious Creatures &amp; Clever Traps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a enigmatic foes, werewolves prowling the corridors, wardens standing\u00a0sentinel, and heyulas hidden beneath tiles. Be careful to vents, projectiles, and\u00a0cracks. Key-finding and Sokoban-style block puzzles add layers of intrigue as you\u00a0reveal the mansion\u2019s secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086710/extras/983d9cf01eb933baf1a262d1464e7ff2.poster.avif?t=1760366922\" width=616 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086710/extras/983d9cf01eb933baf1a262d1464e7ff2.webm?t=1760366922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>If you find it easy, wait for it coming more soon.</i></strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086710?t=1760366922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086710?t=1760366922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086710/0441cd3f6722f2d185495cc319f3cbe60a128e31/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760366922",